{"images":[],"manifest":{"budgetTokens":15000,"countMethod":"proxy","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","packSha":"e1fb6d803ebf35568ee291128f1e1d497dcb47bf66233dcc691a78fd9190f610","packTokens":5553,"recipeVersion":"1","redactions":0,"sections":[{"id":"tpl","tokens":67,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"},{"id":"spans","tokens":528,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"answers","tokens":786,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"sentences","tokens":4102,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"task","tokens":8,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"}],"stage":"round-trip"},"pointers":[],"system":"Map each restated sentence to the original intent spans (I-n) and answers (Q-n) it comes from. A sentence that matches none gets empty lists. Every sentence n must appear once.","tools":[],"user":"<artifact id=\"spans\" kind=\"intent\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-1\",\n  \"text\": \"A responsive web app for Pulse Studio, a single-location boutique fitness studio offering yoga, pilates, HIIT, spin, and boxing classes\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-2\",\n  \"text\": \"Members browse the weekly class schedule, view class details, book or cancel a spot, join a waitlist when a class is full\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-3\",\n  \"text\": \"3 screens: Schedule (home), Class Detail, My Bookings\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-4\",\n  \"text\": \"Enforce the studio's booking and cancellation rules: capacity, waitlist, 7-day booking window, 15-minute pre-start window, 2-hour cancellation window, no overlaps, 10-booking limit\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-5\",\n  \"text\": \"Seed data covering current and next week: at least 40 class sessions, 5 instructors, full classes, cancelled classes, demo member with bookings\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-6\",\n  \"text\": \"Bookings must survive page reload via backend or local persistence\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-7\",\n  \"text\": \"Design quality as primary criterion: boutique aesthetic, warm off-white background, per-class-type accent colours, dark mode support, WCAG AA contrast\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-8\",\n  \"text\": \"Full keyboard navigation, screen reader support, semantic structure, 44×44 px touch targets\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-9\",\n  \"text\": \"Automated tests for business rules and end-to-end test\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-10\",\n  \"text\": \"Mobile-first responsive from 360 px, tablet 2-column, desktop side panel\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"answers\" kind=\"answers\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-1\",\n  \"question\": \"Where does Back go from Class Detail?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Back to the screen Class Detail was opened from (Schedule or My Bookings), keeping that screen's state\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"question\": \"Which rules apply when joining a waitlist?\",\n  \"answer\": \"The same 7-day and 15-minute windows plus the past and studio-cancelled rules as booking; overlap and the 10-booking limit are only checked at promotion\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-3\",\n  \"question\": \"How does Undo work on the 5-second booking toast?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Undo removes the booking as if it was never made: no cancellation record, no late-cancel warning, counts restored\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"question\": \"How is the 7-day booking window measured?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Booking is allowed if the class starts within 7×24 hours from now (Europe/London)\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"question\": \"There is only one real member, so how is waitlist promotion modelled and shown?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Other members exist only as booked and waitlist counts. When Alex cancels, the booked count stays the same and the waitlist count drops by one. Alex's own promotion is triggered by a test/demo hook that simulates another member cancelling\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"question\": \"Are the seed dates fixed calendar dates, or worked out from today's date when the app first loads?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Worked out from today (Europe/London) on first load, then stored\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"question\": \"Is a late cancellation ('counts as a missed class') stored differently and shown in Past or the stats?\",\n  \"answer\": \"It is stored as Cancelled with a late flag and shown in Past as 'Late cancel'; stats are unaffected\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"question\": \"Nobody on staff can mark attendance, so what happens to a Booked class once it has finished?\",\n  \"answer\": \"It moves to Past and is shown and counted as Attended automatically\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"sentences\" kind=\"restated\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"n\": 1,\n  \"text\": \"The app shall be a responsive single-location boutique studio booking web app offering Yoga, Pilates, HIIT, Spin and Boxing classes, with exactly three screens: Schedule (home), Class Detail, and My Bookings.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 2,\n  \"text\": \"There is a single pre-signed-in member with no sign-in screen, and a top bar showing the studio wordmark and an avatar linking to My Bookings.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 3,\n  \"text\": \"All dates, day boundaries and time-based rules shall be computed in the Europe/London timezone and times shall be displayed in 24-hour HH:mm format.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 4,\n  \"text\": \"A seed generator shall produce at least 40 class sessions across the 5 types and 3 rooms, 5 instructors with name, bio and avatar, at least 3 full sessions, at least 3 sessions with 1-3 spots left, at least 1 studio-cancelled session, and specific demo booking records for the member.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 5,\n  \"text\": \"On app load, seed sessions shall be generated for the current and next Monday-Sunday week and stored in local storage if none exists, or reused unchanged if stored data exists.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 6,\n  \"text\": \"Any booking action shall persist bookings, statuses, late flags, session counts and waitlist positions to local storage before reporting success, so data survives new instances and reloads.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 7,\n  \"text\": \"Booking a scheduled session with free spots, within the booking window, without overlap, and under the 10-booking limit shall create a Booked record and increase the booked count by 1.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 8,\n  \"text\": \"A further book or join-waitlist request for a session already booked or waitlisted by the member shall be rejected with an already-booked error without changes.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 9,\n  \"text\": \"A book request on a full session shall be rejected with a class-full error leaving counts unchanged.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 10,\n  \"text\": \"Joining a waitlist on a full, in-window scheduled session shall create a Waitlisted record with position equal to previous waitlist count plus 1 and increase waitlist count by 1; joining on a non-full session shall be rejected with a not-full error.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 11,\n  \"text\": \"Book and join-waitlist requests for sessions starting more than 168 hours ahead shall be rejected with an outside-booking-window error; exactly 168 hours is allowed.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 12,\n  \"text\": \"Book and join-waitlist requests for sessions starting less than 15 minutes ahead shall be rejected with an outside-booking-window error; exactly 15 minutes is allowed.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 13,\n  \"text\": \"Book, join-waitlist, cancel and leave-waitlist requests for sessions that have already started shall be rejected with a class-has-started error, leaving data unchanged.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 14,\n  \"text\": \"Book and join-waitlist requests on studio-cancelled sessions shall be rejected with a cancelled-by-studio error.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 15,\n  \"text\": \"A book request that would create an overlapping Booked session shall be rejected with an error naming the conflicting class and its time range; back-to-back sessions are not overlapping.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 16,\n  \"text\": \"A book request when the member already holds 10 upcoming Booked sessions shall be rejected with a limit-reached error; Waitlisted records do not count toward this limit.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 17,\n  \"text\": \"Cancelling a Booked record on a not-yet-started session shall set status to Cancelled with a late flag true only if the session starts in under 2 hours.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 18,\n  \"text\": \"Cancelling a Booked record shall reduce waitlist count by 1 (keeping booked count unchanged) if waitlist count is above 0, otherwise reduce booked count by 1.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 19,\n  \"text\": \"Leaving a waitlist on a not-yet-started session shall set the record to Cancelled with late flag false, remove it from Upcoming, and reduce waitlist count by 1.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 20,\n  \"text\": \"A test-only hook simulating another member's cancellation shall promote the first eligible waitlisted member, adjusting the member's record, position, and waitlist/booked counts accordingly.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 21,\n  \"text\": \"If promoting the member would cause overlap, exceed the 10-booking limit, or violate the 15-minute window, the member shall remain waitlisted at position 1 with a stored skip reason, and the next member or booked count shall be adjusted instead, with re-check on next hook run.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 22,\n  \"text\": \"The Class Detail screen shall display the stored skip reason next to the member's waitlist position when applicable.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 23,\n  \"text\": \"On app open, if the member was promoted from waitlist to Booked since the last visit, a one-time toast naming the class shall be shown.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 24,\n  \"text\": \"Undoing a booking from the toast within 5 seconds shall delete the Booked record entirely and restore the session's prior booked count.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 25,\n  \"text\": \"When a Booked session's end time has passed, its record shall be returned with status Attended in the Past list.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 26,\n  \"text\": \"A Booked or Waitlisted record on a session later marked Cancelled by studio shall appear in the Past list with that status.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 27,\n  \"text\": \"The Upcoming list shall contain Booked and Waitlisted records for unfinished sessions, ordered ascending and grouped by day label; the Past list shall contain Attended and Cancelled records ordered most recent first.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 28,\n  \"text\": \"Stats shall report Upcoming count, Classes this month count, and Current streak of consecutive weeks with attendance, unaffected by late cancellations.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 29,\n  \"text\": \"The action state for a session shall be one of Book, Join waitlist, Booked, Waitlisted (with position/reason), or Disabled with reason, per the member's state and session status.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 30,\n  \"text\": \"An availability label function shall return specific text values based on cancellation, fullness, and remaining spot count.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 31,\n  \"text\": \"The Schedule screen shall display the computed availability label on each class card.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 32,\n  \"text\": \"Schedule filtering shall return the selected day's sessions, including cancelled ones, ordered by start time, matching selected type/intensity/time-of-day filters where empty filters match all.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 33,\n  \"text\": \"The Schedule screen shall show a 7-day Monday-Sunday day strip with today highlighted, days without sessions dimmed, and week navigation limited to current and next week.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 34,\n  \"text\": \"The Schedule screen shall show a filter bar with type, intensity, and time-of-day chips and a Clear filters action.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 35,\n  \"text\": \"Each class card shall display time, duration, name, type tag, intensity, instructor, room, capacity bar with label, and action button, with cancelled sessions struck through.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 36,\n  \"text\": \"The card action button label and enabled/disabled state shall reflect the member's booking state and session eligibility.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 37,\n  \"text\": \"Activating a Schedule card or My Bookings row outside its action control shall open the Class Detail screen for that session.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 38,\n  \"text\": \"Booking from a Schedule card shall update the card immediately and show a confirmation toast with an Undo action available for 5 seconds.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 39,\n  \"text\": \"Joining or leaving a waitlist, or cancelling a booking, shall show a confirmation toast without an Undo action.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 40,\n  \"text\": \"If an optimistic booking action is rejected or fails, the screen shall revert to its previous state and show a plain-language error toast with no raw error or stack trace.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 41,\n  \"text\": \"The Schedule screen shall show skeleton cards while loading, an empty-day message, a no-matching-filters message with Clear filters, or an inline error with Retry, as appropriate.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 42,\n  \"text\": \"Using Back on Class Detail shall return to the originating screen with its prior selections (day, week, filters, tab) preserved.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 43,\n  \"text\": \"The Class Detail screen shall show a hero header with class/type/intensity info, schedule details, instructor info, description, what-to-bring list, availability block, and cancellation policy text.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 44,\n  \"text\": \"The Class Detail action footer shall show the appropriate booking/waitlist/cancel control and text based on state, and remain pinned to the bottom on small viewports.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 45,\n  \"text\": \"Cancelling a booking from Class Detail or My Bookings shall open a confirmation dialog, showing a late-cancellation warning when applicable.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 46,\n  \"text\": \"If a booking rejection occurs from Class Detail, the rejection message shall be shown, and if due to the class becoming full, the availability and footer shall update to Join waitlist.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 47,\n  \"text\": \"The My Bookings screen shall show a header, three stat tiles, and Upcoming/Past tabs with grouped rows showing relevant details, badges, and actions.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 48,\n  \"text\": \"The My Bookings screen shall show appropriate empty-state, loading, or error messages depending on data availability.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 49,\n  \"text\": \"The app shall use defined colour design tokens including background, text, semantic colours, and per-class-type accent colours applied consistently.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 50,\n  \"text\": \"The app shall support a dark theme when the system preference is dark.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 51,\n  \"text\": \"The app shall use a defined typography system including display/body fonts, a type scale, and tabular figures for numbers.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 52,\n  \"text\": \"The app shall replace animations with instant changes when reduced motion is preferred.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 53,\n  \"text\": \"All interactive elements shall be reachable and operable by keyboard with visible focus indication.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 54,\n  \"text\": \"The app shall use semantic structure, accessible labels/announcements for capacity, and pair colour signals with text or icons.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 55,\n  \"text\": \"Dialogs shall trap focus and close on Escape, returning focus appropriately.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 56,\n  \"text\": \"The app shall avoid horizontal page scrolling at narrow widths, use responsive column layouts at medium widths, and show Class Detail as a side panel at wide widths.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 57,\n  \"text\": \"All interactive targets shall be at least 44x44 px.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 58,\n  \"text\": \"An automated test suite shall include passing unit tests covering key booking business rules.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 59,\n  \"text\": \"An automated end-to-end test shall cover the schedule-filter-book-cancel flow.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 60,\n  \"text\": \"When stored data does not cover the current or next week, the app shall generate and add missing week sessions without altering existing stored sessions, bookings, or counts.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 61,\n  \"text\": \"Cancel requests on non-Booked records, or leave-waitlist requests on non-Waitlisted records, shall be rejected with an invalid-booking-state error leaving data unchanged.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\nMap the sentences."}